{"id":1085,"date":"2025-09-28T19:22:58","date_gmt":"2025-09-28T13:52:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/titanflowvalves.com\/?page_id=1085"},"modified":"2026-05-18T17:20:59","modified_gmt":"2026-05-18T11:50:59","slug":"power-tools","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/titanflowvalves.com\/power-tools\/","title":{"rendered":"POWER TOOLS"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">power tools: <strong>Titan Flow Valves<\/strong>\u00a0offers a comprehensive range of industrial valves AND TOOLS designed to meet the demanding requirements of various industries including oil &amp; gas, power, water treatment, petrochemicals, steel, and general engineering. Every valve we manufacture is built to deliver high performance, tight shutoff, and long service life.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">OVERVIEW<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At <strong>Titan Flow Valves<\/strong>, we are a trusted name in supplying world-class <strong>hydraulic torque wrenches, battery torque wrenches, manual torque wrenches, hydraulic flange spreaders, integral flange spreaders, nut splitters, and cold cutting machines<\/strong>. As a leading <strong>supplier, manufacturer, dealer, and distributor in India<\/strong>, we deliver reliable, high-performance <strong>industrial bolting and pipeline maintenance solutions<\/strong> to power plants, oil &amp; gas industries, fertilizer plants, chemical plants, and more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>\ud83d\udd27 Hydraulic &amp; Battery Torque Wrenches<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our range includes <strong>hydraulic torque wrenches<\/strong>, available for <strong>rental, calibration, and heavy-duty applications<\/strong>. We also provide advanced <strong>battery torque wrenches<\/strong> (cordless torque wrenches and battery-operated torque tools) designed for precision and efficiency. Whether you need a <strong>manual torque wrench supplier in India<\/strong> or a <strong>high torque hydraulic wrench for oil &amp; gas projects<\/strong>, Titan Flow Valves ensures durable and accurate torque solutions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>\u2699\ufe0f Flange Spreading Tools<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We supply a complete selection of <strong>hydraulic flange spreaders, integral flange spreaders, and compact flange spreaders<\/strong>. Available for <strong>rental, purchase, and industrial applications<\/strong>, our tools are designed for safe, efficient, and reliable <strong>pipeline flange maintenance<\/strong>. Titan Flow Valves is recognized as a top <strong>flange spreader supplier, dealer, and distributor in India<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>\ud83d\udd28 Hydraulic Nut Splitters<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a reputed <strong>hydraulic nut splitter supplier in India<\/strong>, Titan Flow Valves provides <strong>portable nut splitters, heavy-duty nut splitters, and industrial nut splitting tools<\/strong>. Our <strong>bolt &amp; nut splitter tools<\/strong> are built to handle seized or corroded fasteners safely, making them essential for <strong>pipeline, refinery, and power plant operations<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>\u2744\ufe0f Cold Cutting Machines<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are a trusted <strong>cold cutting machine supplier and manufacturer in India<\/strong>, offering <strong>portable cold cutting machines, onsite pipe cutting equipment, and cold cutting solutions for oil &amp; gas and pipelines<\/strong>. With a focus on safety and efficiency, our <strong>cold cutting machines<\/strong> eliminate sparks, heat, and distortion during operation\u2014ideal for critical plant maintenance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>\ud83c\udfed Industrial Bolting &amp; Maintenance Solutions<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Backed by years of expertise, Titan Flow Valves delivers <strong>industrial torque tools, hydraulic bolting equipment, nut splitting tools, and flange spreading equipment<\/strong> tailored for heavy industries. We specialize in <strong>torque wrench calibration in India<\/strong>, <strong>torque tools for oil &amp; gas, power plants, chemical plants, and fertilizer industries<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From <strong>hydraulic torque tools<\/strong> to <strong>pipeline flange maintenance equipment<\/strong>, Titan Flow Valves is your one-stop partner for <strong>reliable, safe, and high-performance industrial tools<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0 Types of POWER TOOLS We Offer:<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-f56f613f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized is-style-rectangular is-style-rounded\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-attachment-id=\"1110\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/titanflowvalves.com\/power-tools\/gemini_generated_image_y8d6sgy8d6sgy8d6\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/titanflowvalves.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Gemini_Generated_Image_y8d6sgy8d6sgy8d6.png?fit=1024%2C1024&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1024,1024\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" 